<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chevron said started buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chevron said started buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer analyst L. Bruce Lanni started coverage of Chevron with a buy rating and an 12-month price target of $80 on Thursday, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed on Wednesday at 65-3/8.</p>
